      <title>Seventh American service member dies amid U.S. war with Iran</title>
      <link>https://www.nbcnews.com/video/seventh-american-service-member-dies-amid-u-s-war-with-iran-258936901794</link>
      <description>U.S. Central Command announced the death of a seventh service member today. The military says the service member was seriously wounded in an attack on troops in Saudi Arabia on March 1. And Iranian state media reports Mojtaba Khamenei has been selected as Iran’s next supreme leader, a week after his father was killed in U.S.-Israeli strikes. NBC News’ Matt Bradley reports.</description>
